OL,13,     FNorth America: David Attenborough
OL,14,     Fviews life in North America, with
OL,15,     Ffootage of roadrunners cruising
OL,16,     Fthe deserts of Arizona, and polar
OL,17,     Fbears hunting beluga whales.
